---
import ServiceLayout from '../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<ServiceLayout
  title="New Construction Plumbing"
  description={`New construction plumbing services in Asheville & Hendersonville, NC for residential and commercial projects. Call ${site.phone} to learn more.`}
  heroTitle="New Construction Plumbing"
  heroSubtitle="Start your build on solid plumbing: new construction plumbing services in Asheville & Hendersonville, NC."
  heroImage="/images/gallery/gallery-18.jpg"
  listHeading="3 reasons it's important to have reliable plumbing"
  listItems={[
    'Establish a strong system that will stand the test of time',
    'Prevent malfunctions by completing thorough work the first time',
    'Install quality and efficient components and appliances',
  ]}
  listNote="Consult Nesbitt's Plumbing today about establishing the plumbing in your new construction project."
  ctaHeading="Building Something New?"
  photosHeading="New Construction Projects"
  photos={[
    { src: '/images/gallery/crew-on-site.jpg', alt: 'Two Nesbitt\'s Plumbing crew members on a job site near Asheville, NC', caption: 'Our crew on the job' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-25.jpg', alt: 'Underground plumbing rough-in on a large new construction site in Western North Carolina', caption: 'Underground rough-in on a large new build' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-05.jpg', alt: 'New construction drain rough-in in Asheville, NC', caption: 'Drain lines set before the slab' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-19.jpg', alt: 'Commercial plumbing at Starbucks in Waynesville, NC', caption: 'Starbucks, Waynesville' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-23.jpg', alt: 'Commercial under-slab plumbing in Asheville, NC', caption: 'Commercial under-slab plumbing' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-24.jpg', alt: 'PVC drain lines in a trench on a new construction site in Western North Carolina', caption: 'Drain lines in the trench' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-26.jpg', alt: 'Water lines run through new metal framing in a new build', caption: 'Water lines through new framing' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-27.jpg', alt: 'Bank of five tankless water heaters installed on a block wall', caption: 'Bank of tankless water heaters' },
    { src: '/images/gallery/gallery-18.jpg', alt: 'Water, sewer and storm drain installation at KOA campground in Canton, NC', caption: 'KOA campground, Canton: water, sewer and storm drain install' },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    You're building in Asheville or Hendersonville, NC, and every piece of the project has to line
    up right. When it's time to put in the plumbing, bring in Nesbitt's Plumbing. We have the
    equipment and the crews to handle site work on commercial and residential projects.
  </p>
  <p>
    Dial <a href={site.phoneHref} class="font-semibold text-drop-600 hover:underline">{site.phone}</a>
    to learn more about our new construction services.
  </p>
  <p>
    Plumbing is one thing you want dependable from day one. Our crews install strong, efficient
    systems built to run trouble-free for the long haul.
  </p>
</ServiceLayout>
